Major changes in the life of a parent show up in either the fourth or tenth-house aspects. The fourth house describes the more nurturing parent, the tenth the more authoritative parent as well as other authority figures in one's life. When the progressed fourth or tenth-house cusps conjunct or square Saturn, I have seen big changes in the life of a parent, from career changes, to retirement, to even death. I had a client who was very concerned about her mother. However, it was her employer who passed away under this Saturn aspect.
In esoteric astrology, the fourth-house cusp is linked with past-life soul experiences, and the tenth house is a person s destiny, mission, or path during this lifetime. The progressed tenth-house cusp making a good aspect to a planet can take you further along on your path. The progressed fourth-house cusp making a powerful aspect may bring people into your life who were important to you in past lives.

The Social and Creative Axis
The fifth and eleventh-house cusps have to do with all forms of our creativity and the social organizations to which we belong. It is the axis of creation, social intercourse, and speculation.
The fifth house describes whatever is created, whether it be love given, a child, a book, or a work of art. This house reflects all forms of creative effort. It is difficult to have a smooth-flowing love relationship if the progressed fifth-house cusp is making harsh aspects, but a relationship will take off" and be smooth-flowing if the aspects are harmonious. This is also true of any creative projects
and relationships with your children. At this time in my life, my progressed fifth and eleventh-house cusps are making good aspects to Venus, so I feel that my creativity is heightened, my social life is terrific, and all of my children's lives are v^orking very well.
Understanding the effect of a progressed house cusp aspecting a planet can be very helpful to a client. I had a client who was experiencing "writer's block." He was ready to leave his writing profession and switch to something else. When I looked at his chart and saw that his progressed fifth-house cusp was separating from a square to natal and progressed Saturn, I told him he had not lost his ability to write. The block was temporary, and the aspect would pass. Instead, for just a little bit longer, it was a good time for him to do research and work on other things. He was so relieved when he knew the effect would be over soon.
The effect of a cusp making an aspect can be felt for up to two years, but it usually lasts for one year. It is most powerful when applying to an aspect. Once the aspect is exact, the effect lessens. The effect can linger for fixed signs even when separating. However, if, for example, your Moon is at 23° Aquarius, and your Pluto is at 24° Cancer, and the progressed fifth-house cusp in Scorpio squares your Moon, it will then quickly trine the Pluto, so the adverse aspect will be very brief
Frequently, a woman will find herself pregnant when her progressed fifth-house cusp makes a harmonious aspect. If it con-juncts a planet in Gemini, twins or two children born very close together may result. I had a client who had gotten pregnant very easily in the past, and she decided she would like a fourth child. This time, it took her two years to get pregnant because her progressed fifth-house cusp was conjuncting Saturn, so conception was delayed.
If Sagittarius is on the progressed fifth-house cusp or if the cusp is in aspect to Jupiter, the person might have two suitors. The progressed

fifth-house cusp squaring Neptune can indicate a deceptive, unrealistic love affair. However, I have also seen great works of art produced under this square. If it is in easy aspect to Venus, an artist
