The electric magnetism of Uranus, the excitement, the restlessness, and the desire to make changes starts to be felt 5° or 6° approaching. There usually is an event when the aspect is exact—something manifests right on the exact day. The essence of the transit remains at least 2° past.

Neptune's magic, inspiration, charisma, and mesmerizing and elusive qualities, including openness to deception, disillusionment, and disorientation, go into effect several degrees early, and will be in effect 2° past. Under positive influences, creativity will be heightened, and spirituality and idealism will be enhanced during the period of the transit.
The power of Pluto starts to be felt as many as 4° or 5° approaching and several degrees past a planet. As with Uranus and Neptune, the very slow-moving planets, you can expect to feel these influences operating for several years. But I do expect events to happen on the exact day of contact, particularly if the planet is stationing retrograde or direct. The positive transits of Pluto are very subtle. Many times when the aspect is totally past, you realize you were empowered in some way during that period.
