When Jupiter transits the fifth house, enters the sign Leo, or aspects the Sun, it will be a positive time for your children and your interaction with them. It is a great time for socializing, recreation, sports, and creativity. It is also a good time for conception, but, because Jupiter can overdo, I have seen clients have multiple births at this time. It is a fortunate time for gambling, speculation, and, of course, romance.
Jupiter is a generous planet, and in Leo this is enhanced.
When Jupiter transits the sixth house, enters the sign Virgo, or aspects Mercury, it can be very positive time for work, in your working environment, and in your interaction with coworkers. You can hire very good employees, and your productivity can be at an all-time high. Health can be good if
you do not overindulge. If you are not health-conscious, you must diet and exercise, or you may put on weight. It is also a time when people can get a pet. All mental pursuits are rewarding. Communication flows and you feel understood.
